WEBVTT

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:30.296
You are an upstanding person

00:01:30.320 --> 00:01:32.120
who just happens to be gay.

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:35.656
Don't put yourself over there

00:01:35.680 --> 00:01:37.800
when you are over here."

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:41.120
She thought she'd done me a favor,

00:01:42.440 --> 00:01:43.760
and in a way, she had.

00:01:44.920 --> 00:01:51.256
Her call clarified
what I am trying to do with my life

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:53.896
and in my work as a writer,

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:56.720
which is to send one simple message:

00:01:57.560 --> 00:02:01.000
the way we're taught to live
has got to change.